  46:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Set the Read protection Level
  47:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Program the user Option Bytes
